        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Prepare to uncover more mysteries of the elven lands and beyond in 8Floor's new installment of Elven Rivers 5!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Undersea, kingdom of the depths, is no longer threatening to invade the surface. The succession crisis has divided the nation in half, there's a giant Kraken roaming through the desolate palace, and wherever you go, you can hear bones cracking ever so faintly... </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Celene will have to gather every ounce of courage to tackle this case, it seems! Thankfully, it should be possible to find allies here, too, and unite against the evil lurking in the eternal shadow of the ocean bed. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sounds hopeful enough! But reaching out to strangers and building a trusting relationship with a whole different culture always comes with its own set of risks...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >* Navigate between mysterious monsters and peculiar politicking of the Undersea!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >* Meet two pride heirs to the Salt Throne, and find a way to impress and befriend them!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >* Choose between multiple game modes: from a relaxed story-driven experience to an intense race against time</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >* Find collectibles and earn achievements</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
        "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Prepare to uncover more mysteries of the elven lands and beyond in 8Floor's new installment of Elven Rivers 5!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Undersea, kingdom of the depths, is no longer threatening to invade the surface. The succession crisis has divided the nation in half, there's a giant Kraken roaming through the desolate palace, and wherever you go, you can hear bones cracking ever so faintly... </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Celene will have to gather every ounce of courage to tackle this case, it seems! Thankfully, it should be possible to find allies here, too, and unite against the evil lurking in the eternal shadow of the ocean bed. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sounds hopeful enough! But reaching out to strangers and building a trusting relationship with a whole different culture always comes with its own set of risks...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >* Navigate between mysterious monsters and peculiar politicking of the Undersea!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >* Meet two pride heirs to the Salt Throne, and find a way to impress and befriend them!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >* Choose between multiple game modes: from a relaxed story-driven experience to an intense race against time</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >* Find collectibles and earn achievements</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
